# The keys that stop the machine, in the kernel, at the key: moonwater_poweroff, moonwater_reset and
# moonwater_ctrl_alt_delete. The kernel's floor powers off or reboots with no table at all; these say it as rules.
rule power
	on key power
	place kernel
	do poweroff

rule reset
	on key reset
	place kernel
	do reboot

rule ctrl-alt-delete
	on key ctrl-alt-delete
	place kernel
	do reboot
